            <sparkle:version>51</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.10.33</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.33

- Removed the playback-control latency introduced by an unnecessary debounce and browser metadata probe.
- Sent commands immediately to the cached, URL-verified YouTube Music or Spotify Web tab.
- Preserved protection against unrelated Chrome media while rediscovering and retrying only when the music tab moves or closes.
]]></description>
