            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.32

- Kept the play/pause icon synchronized with the music player's confirmed playback state.
- Removed premature icon changes while browser or native playback commands are still being processed.
- Preserved immediate button feedback and rapid-click coalescing without displaying an incorrect state.
]]></description>
